;; lobby-profile.gc now lands boot-memory-card's real body (states 125-140
;; plus 162, its own scoped decode), so a cold boot reaches the real profile
;; screen instead of bridging past it; see that file for the landing and its
;; own marker census. lobby-net-startup.gc's pre-game-type-menu/waiting-for-
