;; :event handler (landed, real body, above in this file) go-virtuals into
;; four more numbered slots on player input -- 97 (customize), 26 (secrets),
;; new-load-save-profile (profile, landed lobby-profile.gc, issue 699 rung
;; 3b), 51 (multiplayer) -- and adventure-init's own :code (landed, real
;; body, above in this file) go-virtuals unconditionally into 151
